        {
          "step": "1",
          "title": "Build Part",
          "text": "1. Build Part\r\nParts are the building blocks of Wasp.\r\nThe most basic way of initializing a part is to define t he geometry (as brep or mesh),\r\nand the connection faces (center and orientation - with a line). Parts must be named\r\nto be identifyed in the aggregation rules.",
