        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "title": "Define Aggregation Start Point",
          "text": "2. Define Aggregation Start Point\r\nBy using the TransformPart component, it is possible to apply\r\ncustom transformations to a part, positioning it in the right location\r\nto define the aggregation starting point.\r\nThe tranformed part (or parts) can then be provided as input in\r\nthe PREV input of the Aggregation component.",
